  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.29,
      328.69,
      529.37,
      364.24
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KALUTARA URBAN COUNCILUNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      377.17,
      448.07,
      388.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Kalutara Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      401.17,
      539.95,
      448.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which JayanthiWeerasinghe the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaid Ordinance, to decide uponreturned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      461.17,
      539.92,
      484.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Kanda Baduge Dusil Kamalawathi Fernando to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      497.17,
      539.91,
      532.24
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Pahala Ralalage Nalaka Hemantha Rathnayake, returning officer of the Kalutara UrbanCouncil acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Kanda Baduge Dusil Kamalawathi Fernando was selected as the member of the Kalutara Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      430.65,
      557.17,
      529.05,
      592.24
    ],
    "text": "NALAKA RATHNAYAKE,Returning Officer,Kalutara Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      605.17,
      148.66,
      642.76
    ],
    "text": "District Election Office,Kalutara,17th September, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
